   "text": "How to read this\n\u2022 Simulated: the store events, the\npayment provider, the households\nand payments.\n\u2022 Real: PostgreSQL constraints and\nlocks, the worker process, video\ndecoding and measurement.\n\u2022 Not claimed: production readiness\n(the four-process soak FAILED).",
   "originalText": "How to read this\n\u2022 Simulated: the store events, the\npayment provider, the households\nand payments.\n\u2022 Real: PostgreSQL constraints and\nlocks, the worker process, video\ndecoding and measurement.\n\u2022 Not claimed: production readiness\n(the four-process soak FAILED).",
